  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "The table below gives the values of a continuous function $f(x)$ over the closed interval $[1,10]$ with a regular step size. Estimate the area under the curve $y=f(x)$ over the interval $[1,10]$ using a left Riemann sum with $3$ equal subintervals.\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $4$ | $7$ | $10$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $1$ | $2$ | $0$ | $2$ |",
